1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,022
Wrong person.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,752
But you're…

3
00:00:03,825 --> 00:00:05,068
Please leave, sir.

4
00:00:07,859 --> 00:00:09,335
He knows A-Ling?

5
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:10,044
No idea.

6
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:11,429
She'll talk when she's ready.

7
00:00:12,051 --> 00:00:12,573
Still up?

8
00:00:13,251 --> 00:00:14,250
You want to ask.

9
00:00:14,451 --> 00:00:14,933
I do.

10
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,296
But you don't want to say.

11
00:00:16,359 --> 00:00:18,966
He saw me behind very high walls.

12
00:00:19,034 --> 00:00:20,123
Don't ask.

13
00:00:20,234 --> 00:00:21,511
Okay. I won't.

14
00:00:21,634 --> 00:00:23,866
A-Ling: affection plus four.

15
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:26,041
Three months,

16
00:00:26,155 --> 00:00:28,059
not one drop of rain.

17
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:29,191
Seeds won't wait.

18
00:00:29,403 --> 00:00:30,680
First, wake them up.

19
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:31,900
They sprouted!

20
00:00:32,499 --> 00:00:34,801
Xu Yan, sprouts in three days!

21
00:00:34,877 --> 00:00:35,412
Xu!

22
00:00:35,691 --> 00:00:37,700
The— the stream's dry!

23
00:00:42,653 --> 00:00:44,018
No water upstream,

24
00:00:44,092 --> 00:00:45,830
the fields'll all die!

25
00:00:46,037 --> 00:00:47,080
And the Qians' fields?

26
00:00:47,367 --> 00:00:48,409
The Qians…

27
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,413
Theirs are still green.

28
00:00:50,487 --> 00:00:51,838
Grain prices,

29
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:54,200
up another thirty percent.

30
00:00:54,843 --> 00:00:57,342
No rain from heaven,

31
00:00:58,435 --> 00:01:01,569
so heaven counts my money.

32
00:01:01,715 --> 00:01:03,293
Drought mission:

33
00:01:03,379 --> 00:01:07,654
water Liuxi's fields within ten days.

34
00:01:07,742 --> 00:01:10,578
Failure: the seedlings die.

35
00:01:10,662 --> 00:01:11,493
Upstream.

36
00:01:15,044 --> 00:01:15,911
Xu, look!

37
00:01:18,865 --> 00:01:20,793
They're sending it to the Qians' fields!

38
00:01:20,857 --> 00:01:22,015
Give us back our water!

39
00:01:22,549 --> 00:01:23,267
Erniu!
